# rock-large - two large debris variants (frames are variants, not animation). 32x32 each.
# Top-down, light top-left. Low-poly planes: lit faces up-left, dark faces down-right. K exterior outline.
# Frame 0 rust boulder (rust t T h H). Frame 1 grey slag boulder (steel 2 3 4 5) with rust stains.
# Smallest feature: 2-3 px pits (dark wall up-left, lit lip down-right).
